%N A094836 a(n) = 2702*a(n-1) - a(n-2); a(-1) = -15; a(0) = 15.
%C A094836 Trisection of A028230.
%H A094836 Akshay Bansal, <a href="/A094836/b094836.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = -1..190</a>
